body:

The Mountaineering Acoustics Network (MAN), launched in 2025 as part of the Mountaineering Acoustics Network & Terrain Lab Equipment
(<logo>MANTLE</logo>), is a not-for-profit initiative focused on mountaineering acoustics.
We carry out field recording in mountain environments and work with audio processing; machine learning is applied where it supports the analysis.

Selected field recordings and releases are published via [Mantle Production](https://prod.mantle-sound.org/).

## Team

For general inquiries: [gewenxin.yu@proton.me](mailto:gewenxin.yu@proton.me) · [Matrix](https://matrix.to/#/@g.yu:matrix.org)

### Contributors

- **Mingda Cai** (recording assistant), **Dong Sheng & Xiao Zhang** (local mountain guides, Kangding) – Yema Haizi, Jan 2026
